                        "form_id": "16fe94ad-3b45-4979-81d1-b55135cc8b4f",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "злополу́чнее"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "45c62fcb-44cf-4645-9575-8b83cc45bcd0",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "злополу́чней"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2a2159c3-0dde-331f-92c5-4217a27cf904",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "преисполненный бедствий и неудач"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dbc06e17-9a98-4332-a3ba-a6e7970add40",
                                "sense_id": "2a2159c3-0dde-331f-92c5-4217a27cf904",
                                "text": "В ту злополучную ночь я впервые спал в углу на своих рукописях."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f3f8b538-18da-3fbc-be4a-99427348c930",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "невезучий, несчастливый"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bf4f00c5-4bbc-407b-939e-6182b2736f98",
                                "sense_id": "f3f8b538-18da-3fbc-be4a-99427348c930",
                                "text": "Святослав Ольгович Северский пригласил Давыдовичей соединиться с ним для освобождения из плена злополучного Игоря."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bea8ff72-e0ee-35df-9f53-969ea7322504",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "послуживший причиной неприятности, недоразумения"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "841f6ca8-4493-4498-b859-410d198bd6b2",
                                "sense_id": "bea8ff72-e0ee-35df-9f53-969ea7322504",
                                "text": "Потом взяла со столика злополучный буклет, чтобы его увидели все зрители."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2e6148f-4c2d-3cd0-9ea1-4f94785e8318",
                        "entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "связанный в памяти, в представлении с какими-либо неудачными, несчастливыми обстоятельствами"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "46eeb3f0-f81b-4d26-8ff4-3c741a743f49",
                        "source_entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "target_lang_word": "ill-starred",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ill-starred",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ae13b5d1-5071-3e36-a4bc-4f334affb7cc",
                                        "entry_id": "3715b8ba-7c65-3152-96d1-c85645f9da65",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Doomed to a bad fate; hapless."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c37bfad2-a37c-4e0b-b78b-5a9fe87837f7",
                                                "sense_id": "ae13b5d1-5071-3e36-a4bc-4f334affb7cc",
                                                "text": "\"Do not name it!\" answered he, passionately. \"God forgive me! I cannot yet bear its name. But for its ill-starred birth, Henriette might now be living. What is there in that unconscious infant to replace its mother?\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e5e055d0-fc26-4519-8bd5-7116316416b8",
                                                "sense_id": "ae13b5d1-5071-3e36-a4bc-4f334affb7cc",
                                                "text": "[…] it appears the possibility of the ill-starred Uxbridge-Rickmansworth rail link being built is now bound up with post-war planning. [it was never built]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "40ff9b51-84a2-4012-b41f-f9bbe448bf37",
                        "source_entry_id": "5290bf7c-30ae-3c6b-9ec7-ebbe779c9ae2",
                        "target_lang_word": "ill-fated",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "ill-fated",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                        "entry_id": "4159365e-effe-358b-be93-7a83c60a7c72",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unlucky; doomed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d1d7cb49-d1e6-4489-8434-e979ad5ccacb",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "My grandfather was originally scheduled to travel on the ill-fated last voyage of the RMS Lusitania, but thankfully had to change his plans at the last minute."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b76a3878-27f9-4c3d-bc2b-bb2a86080e12",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "The engine of the ill-fated mail was Stephenson, one of Whale's 4-6-0 \"Experiment\" class, which fact led to sensational outcryings in the daily papers about the scandal of \"experimental machines\" being used on fast trains!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fbebe8e-9b83-462c-a970-0fb550ba5737",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "In February 1927, eight short months before minstrel Al Jolson sang “My Mammy” to enthralled moviegoers who had never before heard pictures talk, the ill-fated silent movie industry had itself one last fling: Paramount Pictures' romantic comedy It, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f39ecff-2134-4961-b22d-d466801d486f",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "Despite his ill-fated spell at Anfield, he received a warm reception from the same Liverpool fans he struggled to win over before being sacked midway through last season."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "adb09e41-808b-4ce7-9ced-4cc0c298ffb4",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "With Christie's words about \"all-talk-no-action\" in mind, notice that Obama and his two secretaries of state, Hillary Clinton and John Kerry, as well as his vice president, Joe Biden, were all senators, the last two serving for two or three decades, respectively. Not forgetting the ill-fated secretary of defense, Senator Chuck Hagel."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "838c5fc7-7e6b-4140-a1fa-29bd4fbe160f",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "Yingluck is facing a possible 10-year prison term on charges of negligence linked to an ill-fated rice subsidy programme that cost the state billions of dollars."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3f7203c-7aa5-4cf2-a434-5df984fc3bc1",
                                                "sense_id": "f5f1e9fa-c25b-3cb8-9cbc-d1808e89e354",
                                                "text": "There is a broad-gauge transfer shed, lengths of running track with reconstructed stations, and a bit of Brunel's ill-fated atmospheric railway."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
